<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Hicor to raise 3 mln rand in share issue.</title>
<headline>Hicor to raise 3 mln rand in share issue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Hicor Ltd said on Friday  that it planned to raise three million rand through the issue of five  million new Hicor shares at 60 cents each to Nedbank Nominees Ltd.</p>
<p>It said the Nedbank grouping was a nominee on behalf of a number of  institutional and other investors.</p>
<p>It said the cash issue would strengthen institutional shareholing  in Hicor and that the proceeds would be used to fund growth and development  of the business.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
